Package: excalibur-control-center
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: excalibur-control-center-dkms
Description: Hardware telemetry and RGB UI for CASPER EXCALIBUR laptops
 Native Qt6 desktop application that shows CPU/GPU temperature and fan RPM
 telemetry exposed through the Linux hwmon interface, plus diagnostics and a
 system tray. The hwmon telemetry is read-only, and no fan, power, or
 performance control is added. RGB LED control is present but works only when
 the excalibur-wmi driver is loaded with its write path explicitly enabled
 (off by default); RGB firmware behaviour is not verified on real hardware.

Package: excalibur-control-center-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: excalibur-control-center, linux-headers-amd64 | linux-headers-generic
Description: excalibur-wmi hwmon driver sources (DKMS)
 DKMS kernel module sources for the CASPER EXCALIBUR G870 (NLXB 001). The dkms
 framework builds the module against each installed kernel. The hwmon
 temperature/fan telemetry is read-only and no fan, power, or performance
 control is added. The driver also contains an RGB LED write path that is gated
 off by default and must be explicitly enabled at load time; RGB firmware
 behaviour, physical zone mapping, effects, and brightness are not verified on
 real hardware, and enabling the gate does not make the firmware operation safe
 or guaranteed to work. Requires the 7.2.x kernel WMI API
 (wmidev_set_block/query_block).
